<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10957"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 1:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here is an interviw with the two first officers on the Otero murder scene and one of them Jack Watkins  says: <BR> <BR> &#34;The only thing that bothered me about this was the little boy. It always has. Children, I think, should be omitted from this sort of thing,&#34; said Watkins.  <BR> <BR>WHAT IS GOING ON????????!!!!!!!! WITH THIS GUY???? HE SAID THE ONLY THING THAT BOTHRED HIM, HOW COME HE WASN´T BOTHRED BY JOSEPHINE, JOSEPH SR. AND JULIE´S DEATH????? <BR> <BR>PLEASE HELP ME OUT HERE?  <BR> <BR>IS THIS A BTK GUY??? &#40;he even looks like a younger dennis rader&#41; <BR> <BR>i´M IN SHOCK!!! How could he say that????????? <BR> <BR>Here is a link to both the vido and the transcript of the video: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.ksn.com/news/stories/7126966.html" target=_top>http://www.ksn.com/news/stories/7126966.html</a> <BR> <BR>By the way the officer Bob Bulla, who found little Josepihne is the other officer interviwed, at last ge got to see his face. <BR>  <BR>tro<!--/Text--></td></tr>
